Model training layer:
Training data and test data sets were split depending on the date; Random Forest and XGBoost regressors were used to train the models.
Artifact storing layer:
Best model obtained along with the features and preprocessed data was stored for further optimizations in later sprints.

Such architecture allowed easy reuse of code and debugging of the code during the development process.

